{
  "title": "1st Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْ صِیَامِیْ فِیْهِ صِیَامَ الصَّآئِمِیْنَ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A’L SEYAAMEE FEEHE SEYAAMAS SAA-EMEENA \nO Allah! During this month accept my fast as the fast of (accepted) Fast-keepers. \nوَقِیَامِیْ فِیْهِ قِیَامَ الْقَآئِمِیْنَ \nWA QEYAAMEE FEEHE QEYAAMAL QAA-EMEENA \nAccept my standing in Namaz as the standing of the persons whose standing in Namaz is acceptable to Allah, \nوَ نَبِّهْنِیْ فِيْهِ عَنْ نَوْمَۃِ الْغَافِلِیْنَ \nWA NABBEHNEE FEEHE A’N NAWMATIL GHAAFELEENA \nKeep me awake during this month and free from the dreams of the insensible negligent persons. \nوَهَبْ لِیْ جُرْمِیْ فِیْهِ یَا اِلٰهَ الْعَالَمِیْنَ \nWA HAB LEE JURMEE FEEHE YAA ELAAHAL A’ALAMEENA \nIn this holy month forgive my sins and errors, O the One worshipped in all the universe. \nوَاعْفُ عَنِّیْ یَا عَافِیًا عَنِ الْمُجْرِمِیْنَ.\nWA’ FO A’NNEE YAA A’AFEYAN A’NIL MUJREMEENA.\nPardon me O One Who pardons the sinners."
}
